.TH "nvme_init_manage_export_nvms_receive" 9 "nvme_init_manage_export_nvms_receive" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
nvme_init_manage_export_nvms_receive \- Initialize passthru command for Manage Exported NVM Subsystem Receive
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" nvme_init_manage_export_nvms_receive
.BI "(struct libnvme_passthru_cmd *cmd "  ","
.BI "__u8 sel "  ","
.BI "__u8 mos "  ","
.BI "__u16 mose "  ","
.BI "__u16 mosi "  ","
.BI "__u32 ol "  ","
.BI "__u32 ou "  ","
.BI "__u32 numdl "  ","
.BI "void *data "  ","
.BI "__u32 len "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "cmd" 12
Passthru command to use
.IP "sel" 12
Select (SEL): management operation to perform, see \fIenum
nvme_manage_export_nvms_recv_sel\fP
.IP "mos" 12
Management Operation Specific (MOS): specific to \fIsel\fP
.IP "mose" 12
Management Operation Specific Extended (MOSE): specific to
\fIsel\fP
.IP "mosi" 12
Management Operation Specific Identifier (MOSI): specific to
\fIsel\fP
.IP "ol" 12
Offset Lower (OL), in dwords: specific to \fIsel\fP
.IP "ou" 12
Offset Upper (OU), in dwords: specific to \fIsel\fP
.IP "numdl" 12
Number of Dwords (NUMDL) requested, 0's based: specific to
\fIsel\fP
.IP "data" 12
Pointer to data buffer
.IP "len" 12
Length of \fIdata\fP
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Initializes the passthru command buffer for the Manage Exported NVM
Subsystem Receive command.
